.TH GODHCP 8 "2026" "GoDHCP 0.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
godhcp \- DHCPv4 server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B godhcp
[\fB\-config\fR \fIpath\fR]
[\fB\-validate\fR]
.PP
.B godhcp version
.PP
.B godhcp hash-password \-password
.I secret
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B godhcp
is a DHCPv4 server with YAML configuration, a REST API and an embedded web interface.
It answers clients on local VLAN interfaces and behind DHCP relays (option 82).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-config \ path
Configuration file. The default is the
.I GODHCP_CONFIG
environment variable or
.IR configs/dev.yml .
.TP
.B \-validate
Load and validate the configuration, then exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B version
Print the version and copyright.
.TP
.B hash-password
Print an argon2id PHC hash suitable for
.IR api.auth.users .
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGHUP
Reload the configuration file without dropping the process.
.TP
.BR SIGINT ", " SIGTERM
Stop the HTTP API and the DHCP listener.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/godhcp/config.yml
Server configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/godhcp/leases.db
Default SQLite lease database.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project documentation in
.IR docs/ .
